{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\comp\\096.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "awaz e inqilab.com", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[303, 10], [620, 10], [620, 40], [303, 40]]}, {"text": "5.1ComputerEthics", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[316, 73], [603, 75], [603, 105], [316, 103]]}, {"text": "Digital citizenship refers to the responsible use of Information and Communication", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[90, 115], [876, 117], [876, 144], [90, 142]]}, {"text": "Technology (ICT). A good digital citizen has the knowledge and skills to responsibly", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[89, 145], [874, 148], [874, 174], [89, 171]]}, {"text": "use computers, InternetandICT devices.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[89, 178], [459, 177], [459, 201], [89, 202]]}, {"text": "Computer ethics refers to what is right and what is wrong while using digital", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[91, 223], [874, 223], [874, 247], [91, 247]]}, {"text": "technology. It is a set of moral principles forproper and responsible use of Internet", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[89, 253], [873, 253], [873, 276], [89, 276]]}, {"text": "computers and ICT devices.", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[86, 283], [344, 282], [344, 306], [86, 307]]}, {"text": "5.1.1EthicalUseofComputers", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[91, 326], [427, 326], [427, 349], [91, 349]]}, {"text": "The following principles and guidelines are to be followed to be safe, responsible and", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[87, 353], [882, 354], [882, 381], [87, 380]]}, {"text": "respectfulwhile usingdigital technology.", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[88, 383], [461, 385], [460, 413], [88, 411]]}, {"text": "Usecomputerinaresponsiblewaythatshowsrespect.", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[144, 416], [636, 417], [636, 441], [144, 440]]}, {"text": "Never use badlanguage while using social websites.", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[142, 445], [615, 447], [615, 473], [141, 471]]}, {"text": "Do not use computer to harm others,", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[143, 475], [475, 477], [475, 504], [142, 502]]}, {"text": "Donotusecomputertosteal,editordestroyot